<title>JAPAN: Honda sees 97/98 operating profit up 13.3% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Honda sees 97/98 operating profit up 13.3% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd said on Tuesday it expected a group operating profit of 455 billion yen in the current business year to March 1998, up 13.3 percent from a year earlier.</p>
<p>Honda's group operating profit for 1996/97, which ended March 31, stood at 401.45 billion yen, up 179.5 percent from a year earlier.</p>
